Subject: [PATCH] refactor(app): split setup deletion and pin linked staleness

Keep setup deletion guards and undo snapshots together without changing behavior or public command paths. Cover a linked child toolpath becoming stale after parent alignment, fresh after undo, and stale again after redo.

Fixes #398
